                    <td class="px-4 py-4 text-gray-700">5 lithium-ion cells</td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr class="bg-gray-50 border-b border-gray-100">
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 font-black text-gray-900">Typical weight with battery</td>
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 text-gray-700">Roughly 2 to 2.5 lb</td>
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 text-gray-700">Roughly 3 to 3.5 lb compact, 4 lb or more for hammer drills</td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr class="bg-white border-b border-gray-100">
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 font-black text-gray-900">Typical torque claims</td>
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 text-gray-700">Roughly 250 to 400 in-lbs</td>
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 text-gray-700">Roughly 400 to 700 in-lbs, premium models well over 1,000</td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr class="bg-gray-50 border-b border-gray-100">
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 font-black text-gray-900">Common chuck size</td>
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 text-gray-700">3/8 in on many models</td>
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 text-gray-700">1/2 in on most</td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr class="bg-white border-b border-gray-100">
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 font-black text-gray-900">Energy, 2.0Ah pack</td>
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 text-gray-700">About 24 watt-hours</td>
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 text-gray-700">About 36 watt-hours</td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr class="bg-gray-50 border-b border-gray-100">
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 font-black text-gray-900">Hammer drill option</td>
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 text-gray-700">Available on some lines</td>
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 text-gray-700">Widely available</td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr class="bg-white border-b border-gray-100">
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 font-black text-gray-900">Tool family</td>
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 text-gray-700">Smaller, focused on compact tools</td>
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 text-gray-700">Very broad, including saws and yard tools</td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr class="bg-gray-50 border-b border-gray-100">
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 font-black text-gray-900">Best for</td>
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 text-gray-700">Furniture, cabinets, hardware, tight spaces</td>
